200	fetch was bounded (R1), since `_fetchForCriteria` never sets a non-`null` `nextCursor` in that case — no new
201	condition needed in `_onNextPageRequested` itself. `_fetchNextPage` (RF07's existing further-page fetch) gains
202	the same generation-guard wrapping as `_fetchForCriteria` and now also threads `source`/`dateFrom`/`dateTo`
203	through to `_entriesRepository.list(cursor: ..., source: ..., dateFrom: ..., dateTo: ...)` — relevant when
204	exactly one entry type (or none) is selected alongside a date range but no search term.
