219	| # | Scenario | Expected |
220	|---|---|---|
221	| 1 | `SearchTextChanged('a')`, `'an'`, `'ans'` fired within the debounce window, `debounceDuration: Duration.zero` in test | exactly one `search()` call, with the final text |
222	| 2 | `SearchTextChanged('a')` then `SearchTextChanged('')` before the timer fires | `search()` is never called; a filter-only/unfiltered refetch happens instead |
223	| 3 | `FilterSheetApplied` with 1 entry type + a date range, no query | single `list(source: ..., dateFrom: ..., dateTo: ...)` call, cursor-paginated (`nextCursor` non-null when the backend returns one) |
224	| 4 | `FilterSheetApplied` with 2 entry types, no query | two `list()` calls (one per type, `limit: 50`), merged+deduped+sorted by `occurredAt` desc, `nextCursor: null` |
225	| 5 | `FilterSheetApplied` with 2 entry types + an active query | two `search()` calls, merged+deduped+sorted by `similarity` desc |
